WEBVTT

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.920
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.160
Everyone,

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.920
Bofeng House has a special today:

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.240
Miss Situ's favorite

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.720
"Spring Blossom, Autumn Moon" pastries.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.880
They're made with fruits that ripen in every season.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.120
Only ten taels.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.960
You'll also get to sample Miss Situ's special drinks,

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.240
With several to choose from.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:01.000
-I'll take... -I'll take...

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:03.360
Two for me.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.240
I thought I smelled sheep.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.000
Isn't this Wen Xiaomei, the girl I expelled from the academy?

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.160
You filthy shepherd girl.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.200
How did you end up doing odd jobs here?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.200
Tell me, is Yan Fuzhi

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.560
Running a restaurant or a charity?

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:30.360
Exactly. This place will be driven out of business sooner or later.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.400
Grab her.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.360
Let go of me! What are you doing?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.440
What do you want?

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.040
Let go of me!

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.760
At the women's academy,

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.480
Only Yan Fuzhi and Meng Tinghui ever dared defy me.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.560
Now you work for Yan Fuzhi,

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.800
So you're deliberately turning against me.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:49.720
Mei'er.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.720
I'm only here to help out. Please.

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.000
You think you can call me "Mei'er"?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.000
That sheep stench is giving me a headache.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.040
She needs a bath.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.160
Let go of me!

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.840
Let go of me!

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.640
Didn't you say Yan Fuzhi had your back?

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:17.720
Let's see

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.920
Whether she'll come save you.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:20.800
No!

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.000
No, please!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:29.880
Stop!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.360
Please!

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.480
Run!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.400
What did Wen Xiaomei ever do to you?

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.440
How could you be so cruel?

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.160
Finally.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:53.480
I heard you hired someone named Situ Xue

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.600
And she's quite popular here.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.560
Bring her out.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.440
I refuse to believe

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.600
Anyone in Shazhou is prettier than me.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.600
Get out.

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.120
Smash Bofeng House.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.080
You, Song.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:10.880
Lay one finger on this place,

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.000
And your family's silk business

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.400
Will never trade with the Yan family again.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.200
Mei'er, Wen Xiaomei has no power,

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.640
-but the Yan family is the richest around. -Stop!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.280
They're highly respected in Shazhou.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.360
My uncle is the governor of Shazhou,

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.840
And the Left Chancellor stands behind him.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.680
If you haven't got the nerve,

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.160
Crawl back to your silk shop

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.480
And stop embarrassing yourself.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.760
-Move! -Stop! Let her go!

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.320
Smash it.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.120
Tear the place apart!

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.760
Stop!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.800
-My face! -Let go of me!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.760
Blood...

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.240
My face...

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.240
Let go of me!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.760
You hit me?

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.160
You must have a death wish.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.040
Where's that dear friend of yours?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.720
Why isn't she coming to save you?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.680
If I don't see Situ Xue today,

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.480
I'll reduce Bofeng House to rubble.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:06.720
Stop!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.240
You wanted to see me. Let her go.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.000
Miss!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.800
When did you get back?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:40.720
That's none of your business.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.120
I'm here to do something I've always wanted to do.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.080
Meng Tinghui?

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.600
It's you!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.760
You lowborn orphan.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.600
You dared pose as the capital's finest dancer?

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.120
Jiang Mei'er, I'm giving you one chance.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:30.840
Kneel and apologize.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.680
Pay double for the damages.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:33.840
Otherwise...

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.680
We'll die here together.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.320
You think you're worthy?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.160
Mengmeng, you still have the exam.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.800
They're not worth dying over.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:03.920
To deal with a lunatic,

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:05.960
You have to act like one.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.520
My life is worthless.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.240
Taking you spoiled officials' children down with me

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.800
Would make it worthwhile.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.480
Jiang Mei'er.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:18.440
Didn't you want to reduce Bofeng House to rubble?

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:19.800
I'll help you.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.840
One fire, and we'll all burn to death.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.440
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:30.720
Scared now?

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.240
You seemed to enjoy yourselves

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.880
When you were bullying others.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.320
Meng Tinghui, you've gone too far!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.040
Young Master Song,

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.840
Do you want to die with them?

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.760
I'll grant your wish.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.600
Mei'er, she's stolen and swindled since childhood. She's ruthless.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:47.840
She's not worth risking our lives over.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.080
You useless coward!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.120
I'm losing patience.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.480
Kneel, apologize and pay for the damages,

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.200
Or we all die together.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:00.960
Meng Tinghui, I was wrong.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.880
I'll pay.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.360
-You... -Fuzhi.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.280
Take the money.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.040
Young Master Song,

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.240
Who's prettier,

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:10.600
Jiang Mei'er or me?

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.160
You are. You're the prettiest.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.480
And Jiang Mei'er?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.120
Jiang Mei'er is hideous.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.280
A toad, a dung beetle, a slobbering fool.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.240
You useless coward!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.480
Meng Tinghui, Yan Fuzhi, I was wrong.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.960
She forced me into it.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.200
She even scalded me with boiling water before.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.120
You two worthless fools!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.440
Meng Tinghui!

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:39.880
I'll kill you!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.080
I was wrong.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.120
Meng Tinghui, I was wrong.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.640
I'll compensate you too.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.000
Take off all your jewelry.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.080
All right.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.200
Here. Help me take it off.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.320
Is that enough?

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:22.760
Kneel and apologize.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:24.960
Move.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.560
That kowtow was too soft.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.640
I didn't hear it.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.320
I've done everything you demanded.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.960
Can we leave now?

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.640
Why are you covered in dirt? You look awful.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.280
What are you staring at?

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.480
What's so interesting?

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.360
Walk in front. Go!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.000
Make way!

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.120
One hundred twenty.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:31.800
Forty.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.200
Twenty.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.720
Ten.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:40.640
Ten.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:43.960
Mengmeng,

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.280
It's over 300 taels.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:48.040
After paying for Wen Xiaomei's treatment,

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.760
There's still enough to renovate Bofeng House.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.240
Those parasites

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.000
Must have extorted a fortune from the people.

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:54.480
They deserve to be fleeced.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:56.920
Call it robbing the rich to help the poor.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.840
Take the money to Wen Xiaomei tonight.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:01.960
Don't delay her treatment.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.080
All right.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.600
But Mengmeng,

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.080
You scared me half to death back there.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.080
What if...

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:11.760
It was fake.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.440
This special phosphorus powder

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.480
Was prepared for Situ Xue's performance.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.800
It came in handy.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.920
Mengmeng,

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.000
I'm sorry.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.200
I dragged you into this.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.080
Shazhou is a place that devours people.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.960
The special examination is our only way out.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.320
Besides,

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.240
Jiang Mei'er won't let this go.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.040
Bofeng House can be repaired,

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:35.720
But if this affects your provincial exam...

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.120
I study so I can become an official

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.920
And protect the people I care about.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:42.600
Ten years ago,

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.000
I couldn't protect Sister Ah Xiang.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.800
If I can't protect you today,

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.240
Then an official post

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:51.920
Isn't worth having.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.080
If only my Mengmeng were a man.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.680
I'd definitely marry you.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.040
Fuzhi,

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.640
Not so tight.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.640
I can't breathe.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.760
No. I won't let go.

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:15.840
I'll never let go for the rest of my life.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:17.880
My Mengmeng

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.240
Is bound to rise through the ranks.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.600
Then we'll go to the capital together.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.080
Together, to the capital.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.440
Fuzhi,

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.840
With Jiang Mei'er causing all that trouble,

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:34.760
I almost forgot.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:36.840
I made your favorite apricot-skin cakes.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.480
Sister Ah Xiang loved these cakes.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.360
In a few days,

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.600
It will be the anniversary of her death.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:12:59.320
When the day comes,

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.400
I'll go with you.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.000
Lock your doors and windows.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.520
Guard against thieves and robbers.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.560
Lock your doors and windows.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.400
Guard against thieves and robbers.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.520
Let go! Let go of me!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.520
Let go of me!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.520
Let go of me!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.560
Let go of me! Let go!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:56.160
Let go!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.480
Let go of me! Let go!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.800
Let go of me!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.760
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.560
We meet again,

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.960
Miss Meng.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.080
So you really are a little swindler who'd rob and kill.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.560
I was only protecting myself.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:59.360
You're awfully petty, Young Master.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.280
Going to such lengths

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:02.360
Against one defenseless woman...

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.080
Aren't you afraid people will laugh at you?

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.480
Defenseless?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.480
Young Master,

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:09.400
You've seen her now.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.120
The Left Chancellor orders you

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.480
To return to the capital tonight.

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.840
Wait outside.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:15.960
Young Master...

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:16.960
-It's getting late. -Get out.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.640
Keep a close watch on him.

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:34.680
We must take him back to the capital tonight.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:35.760
-Yes. -Yes.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.680
I'm petty?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.440
If Huo An hadn't been working for me,

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.920
I'd already be dead.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.400
You betray others and scheme so deeply.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:48.840
Even if you enter government,

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:51.320
You'll probably become a treacherous official.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.520
With all your power,

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.640
Why not destroy Black Tiger Hall and deal with Ding Chong?

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.600
Instead, you keep making trouble for a helpless woman.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.200
What kind of ability is that?

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:03.840
You dared deceive me.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.240
That leaves only one end for you: death.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:16.520
Why do I keep running into you, you cursed jinx?

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:17.960
-Just leave! -Go!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.400
Couldn't you use the door?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:20.880
You ruined my doors and windows.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.280
How am I supposed to do business?

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.920
Fine. Once you leave, don't come back.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.040
Don't let me see you again.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.640
Shameless bastard!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:28.880
You cursed jinx!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.080
Don't come back, you shameless wretch!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.360
After him!

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:50.920
I didn't know Miss Meng was such a gifted scold.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:52.320
Satisfied?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.880
I was helping you escape.

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.440
The insults had to sound sincere

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:58.400
Or no one would've believed them.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.160
Now we're even.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.880
Can we ever truly be even?

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.560
I'm thirsty. Bring tea.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.920
Still putting on airs while you're being pursued?

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.080
Ding Chong preys on the people

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.240
And commits every kind of evil.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.480
Why don't you go to the capital and petition the Emperor?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.360
Easy for you to say.

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.760
Without a travel permit from Ding Chong,

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.200
Not even a fly can leave Shazhou.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.160
Anyone who secretly heads for the capital

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.720
Is intercepted and killed on the way.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:46.520
The Emperor sits high in the Golden Throne Hall,

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.520
Hearing songs of praise every day,

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:51.120
But never the suffering of his people.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.240
The Left Chancellor controls the entire court.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.880
Everything His Majesty sees and hears is filtered.

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.000
It isn't that His Majesty ignores the people's suffering.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.240
Someone is deliberately hiding it from him.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.360
His Majesty

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.080
Is constrained as well.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:13.160
The two chancellors' protégés are entrenched throughout the court.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.600
They preach propriety and moral order,

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.800
And surely despise the idea of women in government.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.000
Yet His Majesty

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.880
Intends to wield women as a blade

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.320
To cut through this decaying order.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.240
From now on...

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:26.240
We must open government to more people of humble birth

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:27.360
And pursue sweeping reforms.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.080
If your name appears on the honor roll,

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.920
Will you dare call the Left Chancellor hidebound in open court?

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.520
I won't stop at words.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.880
Darkness survives

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.760
Because someone at court holds an umbrella over it.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:41.680
One day,

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.600
When I stand in the Golden Throne Hall,

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.880
I'll burn every one of those umbrellas myself.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.320
You haven't even entered government,

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.200
Yet you dare pass judgment on the court.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.320
Do well in the provincial exam.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.400
Until we meet again.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.640
Let's never meet again.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:08.920
So he's an official from the capital.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.520
Your Majesty,

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.720
You've been in seclusion for five days.

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:54.160
You eat only one vegetarian meal a day.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:57.680
This old servant is deeply worried about your health.

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:00.280
You must eat properly.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.440
The Left Chancellor has arrived.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:11.920
Left Chancellor.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.000
Left Chancellor,

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.200
You mustn't!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.160
No one may enter the Sacred Ancestor Hall

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.600
Without an imperial decree.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.040
-You... -Left Chancellor,

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.840
Please don't make this difficult for me.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:33.080
Move aside.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:44.720
Close the doors.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:04.960
Left Chancellor,

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.040
It's so late.

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:09.480
Why aren't you resting?

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.200
Did you bring me a chicken leg?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:13.920
I'm practically

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:16.360
Starving to death in here.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.120
Absurd!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:22.280
His Majesty has enjoyed himself too much in Shazhou.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.560
Leave for Shazhou at once

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.720
And bring him back within five days.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.040
Left Chancellor,

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.960
The journey to Shazhou alone

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.760
Takes more than five days.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.040
Carry my warrant

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:37.320
And travel day and night.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.880
Every relay station along the route

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.320
Will have fresh horses ready for you.

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.080
Five days?

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:43.640
I...

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.800
Impersonating His Majesty

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.400
Is an unforgivable crime

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.800
Punishable by immediate execution.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:54.800
Five days.

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:56.400
Five days it is.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:04.640
Your Majesty,

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:05.600
Forgive my late arrival.

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:07.320
What have you learned about the garrison?

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:10.480
Shazhou currently has ten battalions,

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:11.680
But the fortifications are crumbling

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:12.680
And no one repairs them.

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.880
Countless suits of armor, weapons, spears and shields

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:15.960
Are rusting away.

00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:17.280
The funds allocated by the court

00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:19.560
Were never truly spent on the military.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.920
Using its status as a strategic stronghold,

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:27.200
Shazhou makes outrageous demands every year

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:29.160
For vast amounts of grain and military pay.

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:31.880
Xu Ting indulges their every demand

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:33.160
And gives them whatever they ask for.

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:35.840
Yet the soldiers remain weak and the horses unfit.

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:38.200
When one man at court is corrupt,

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:40.720
An entire region of Great Ning rots beneath him.

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:42.240
Your Majesty,

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:44.800
Allowing two days for the journey back,

00:22:45.160 --> 00:22:46.160
What should we do next?

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.520
Ding Chong is colluding with the Ministry of War.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:51.160
They all belong to Xu Ting's faction.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.320
I want to see

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:56.520
Beneath Shazhou's yellow sands

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.720
Just how much corruption lies buried.

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:10.760
Here you are, miss.

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:12.480
-Thank you. -Take your time.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:13.400
All right.

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:15.960
Private room number one upstairs.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:19.240
Gentlemen, your wine is here.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:21.040
-Enjoy. -We will.

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:22.600
Come on. Cheers.

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:23.520
Mengmeng.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.920
Mengmeng, look how busy we are.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.880
I thought Jiang Mei'er's rampage

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.000
Would scare customers off for a while.

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.200
Instead, business is better than ever.

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:32.560
Your stepmother won't dare

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.400
Push your father to marry you off now, will she?

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:35.480
Of course not.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.040
I'll make them watch closely.

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:38.760
Who says women can only serve husbands and raise children?

00:23:38.840 --> 00:23:39.720
We can run businesses

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:40.960
And thrive just as well.

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:42.440
Why depend on anyone else?

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:43.880
Wise words, Proprietor Yan.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:47.080
Now that Bofeng House is thriving, I can rest easy.

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:48.920
I need to get back to the academy and study

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:49.960
For the provincial exam.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:51.800
Right. Focus on your exam, Mengmeng.

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:53.080
We'll go to the capital together.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:54.320
You'll make the honor roll,

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:56.360
And I'll open a branch there. We must achieve both.

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:57.360
We will.

00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:58.960
I'll walk you out.

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:07.000
Officers, are you here to dine at Bofeng House?

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:08.440
Private rooms are upstairs. This way, please.

00:24:10.040 --> 00:24:11.640
By order of Governor Ding,

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:13.080
Bofeng House serves unsanitary food

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.680
And the building is in disrepair.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:16.240
It is sealed effective immediately.

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:17.160
Nonsense!

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:18.800
Bofeng House was renovated recently,

00:24:18.880 --> 00:24:20.480
And I personally inspect all the food.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:21.480
Insolence!

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:23.600
The authorities received numerous complaints.

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:24.760
You have no right to argue.

00:24:25.120 --> 00:24:26.680
Everyone not involved, get out.

00:24:29.600 --> 00:24:30.440
Fuzhi.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:32.840
They're harassing us because of Jiang Mei'er.

00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:34.520
We can't fight an official order bearing the seal.

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:35.920
Who's in charge here?

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:37.440
You still have an exam to take.

00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:38.480
I am.

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:39.680
I'm looking for Meng Tinghui.

00:24:40.200 --> 00:24:41.360
I'm Meng Tinghui.

00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:43.880
You posed as Situ Xue to deceive the public

00:24:43.960 --> 00:24:45.360
And made money illegally.

00:24:45.440 --> 00:24:46.520
By order of Governor Ding,

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:47.640
You are being taken to the Shazhou jail.

00:24:47.720 --> 00:24:50.240
That warrant orders a closure, not an arrest.

00:24:50.520 --> 00:24:52.400
The people of Shazhou are watching outside.

00:24:52.480 --> 00:24:53.480
Enough talk.

00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:57.640
Arrest me instead.

00:24:57.720 --> 00:24:58.840
Bofeng House is mine.

00:24:58.920 --> 00:24:59.760
Mengmeng had nothing to do with it.

00:24:59.840 --> 00:25:01.400
Her examination is only days away.

00:25:01.480 --> 00:25:03.360
She'll never be eligible to take it again.

00:25:03.680 --> 00:25:04.520
Take her away.

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:06.080
Mengmeng!

00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:09.280
Mengmeng!

00:25:09.720 --> 00:25:10.560
Mengmeng!

00:25:10.640 --> 00:25:11.960
Why did they arrest her?

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:14.400
-Can we still eat at Bofeng House? -Mengmeng!

00:25:14.480 --> 00:25:16.920
Not if they really seal it.

00:25:21.520 --> 00:25:22.480
This way, gentlemen.

00:25:27.000 --> 00:25:28.200
Ding Chong, that beast.

00:25:28.600 --> 00:25:30.240
Shazhou is parched. Water is worth its weight in gold.

00:25:30.320 --> 00:25:32.080
People sell their own children for a drink of water,

00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:33.480
Yet he wastes it like this.

00:25:34.360 --> 00:25:35.240
Gentlemen,

00:25:35.320 --> 00:25:36.240
What were you saying?

00:25:38.360 --> 00:25:39.600
We were saying

00:25:39.680 --> 00:25:41.520
The golden-thread nanmu timber in this residence

00:25:41.600 --> 00:25:43.480
Would be rare even in the imperial palace.

00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:44.840
The governor says

00:25:44.920 --> 00:25:46.720
If His Majesty has something fine,

00:25:46.800 --> 00:25:48.200
Then ours must be finer.

00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:50.160
This way, gentlemen.

00:25:53.040 --> 00:25:54.080
Young Master,

00:25:54.160 --> 00:25:55.480
I'll kill him right now.

00:27:11.920 --> 00:27:13.000
Excellent!

00:27:13.080 --> 00:27:14.640
That was your finest dance yet.

00:27:15.120 --> 00:27:16.320
I'm pleased today.

00:27:16.400 --> 00:27:17.280
Reward them all.

00:27:20.360 --> 00:27:22.400
Young Master He of Beijian has arrived.

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:30.080
I am He Du,

00:27:30.520 --> 00:27:32.280
Of Beijian's largest Fu Trading House.

00:27:33.160 --> 00:27:34.480
I've just come to Shazhou on business.

00:27:34.560 --> 00:27:36.200
I heard Governor Ding can accomplish anything,

00:27:37.000 --> 00:27:38.440
So I came specially to pay my respects.

00:27:48.760 --> 00:27:49.600
You don't look the part.

00:27:58.720 --> 00:28:02.520
What brings you to drought-stricken Shazhou, this godforsaken place?

00:28:03.000 --> 00:28:05.720
Called Shazhou?

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:09.520
Whether there is drought

00:28:09.600 --> 00:28:11.400
Depends entirely on the Dragon King's mood.

00:28:11.880 --> 00:28:13.040
Here in Shazhou,

00:28:13.120 --> 00:28:16.200
Isn't Governor Ding the Dragon King who commands wind and rain?

00:28:19.200 --> 00:28:21.680
Young Master He certainly knows how to make an entrance.

00:28:22.040 --> 00:28:23.040
Tell me,

00:28:23.120 --> 00:28:24.480
What business are you in?

00:28:24.560 --> 00:28:26.120
The business I conduct

00:28:26.200 --> 00:28:27.720
Is beyond the courage of ordinary men.

00:28:28.560 --> 00:28:29.680
To be frank, Governor Ding,

00:28:30.880 --> 00:28:32.920
I specialize in routes forbidden by the imperial court.

00:28:34.240 --> 00:28:38.040
I most enjoy doing business with men bold enough to defy Heaven.

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:39.880
However,

00:28:39.960 --> 00:28:41.360
Here in Shazhou,

00:28:41.440 --> 00:28:42.880
We have our own rules.

00:28:42.960 --> 00:28:44.040
And here are the rules.

00:28:57.480 --> 00:28:58.360
Young Master He,

00:28:58.440 --> 00:29:00.160
You clearly understand how the world works.

00:29:00.880 --> 00:29:01.880
Then may I ask

00:29:02.280 --> 00:29:04.200
Whether my business in Jiuyou City

00:29:04.280 --> 00:29:05.360
Will be secure?

00:29:08.280 --> 00:29:09.800
Here in Shazhou,

00:29:09.880 --> 00:29:11.880
Even if King Yama comes to claim a soul,

00:29:11.960 --> 00:29:14.480
He must ask my permission first.

00:29:16.160 --> 00:29:17.000
Look.

00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:21.680
Personally bestowed by the Left Chancellor:

00:29:23.480 --> 00:29:25.320
"A Capable Minister Who Brings Order."

00:29:27.760 --> 00:29:29.840
These days, even His Majesty

00:29:29.920 --> 00:29:31.200
Must obey the Left Chancellor.

00:29:31.680 --> 00:29:33.000
With him backing me,

00:29:33.080 --> 00:29:34.440
Here in Shazhou,

00:29:34.520 --> 00:29:36.240
I am Heaven itself.

00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:39.920
So Governor Ding is a favorite of the Left Chancellor.

00:29:40.760 --> 00:29:42.280
Then why remain stuck in Shazhou?

00:29:43.240 --> 00:29:45.120
With the Left Chancellor's power,

00:29:45.200 --> 00:29:47.560
He could recommend you for a post at court

00:29:47.640 --> 00:29:48.960
With no effort at all.

00:29:49.040 --> 00:29:50.360
You mean a promotion?

00:29:51.640 --> 00:29:53.840
That's nothing but empty vanity.

00:29:54.200 --> 00:29:55.720
Nothing compares to living here

00:29:56.160 --> 00:29:57.760
Free and easy.

00:29:58.280 --> 00:29:59.400
In the capital,

00:29:59.480 --> 00:30:01.200
I would have to kneel to His Majesty.

00:30:01.280 --> 00:30:02.560
In Shazhou,

00:30:02.640 --> 00:30:06.200
Everyone kneels to me.

00:30:09.840 --> 00:30:12.120
Governor Ding truly knows how to live freely.

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:14.120
You've opened my eyes.

00:30:14.800 --> 00:30:16.120
Then, about my business...

00:30:16.200 --> 00:30:18.040
Uncle!

00:30:18.120 --> 00:30:19.400
Uncle!

00:30:19.920 --> 00:30:21.760
-Uncle! -Brother.

00:30:21.840 --> 00:30:23.760
Have you caught that lunatic Meng Tinghui yet?

00:30:24.200 --> 00:30:25.800
Can't you see I'm receiving a guest?

00:30:26.480 --> 00:30:28.440
You're all children of powerful families,

00:30:28.520 --> 00:30:29.920
Yet you couldn't handle one orphan girl.

00:30:30.720 --> 00:30:31.960
-Aren't you ashamed? -Brother,

00:30:32.800 --> 00:30:35.040
All of Shazhou belongs to the Ding family.

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:37.440
How can we let an orphan bully our Mei'er?

00:30:37.520 --> 00:30:39.320
-We cannot let this insult stand. -We cannot!

00:30:39.400 --> 00:30:40.720
-Uncle! -Enough.

00:30:41.760 --> 00:30:44.200
Your uncle sent men to arrest her long ago.

00:30:44.520 --> 00:30:45.760
Crushing an orphan girl

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:47.320
Is easier than stepping on an ant.

00:30:48.160 --> 00:30:49.280
Hurry and thank your uncle.

00:30:49.360 --> 00:30:51.440
Thank you, Uncle!

00:30:51.520 --> 00:30:53.680
I recently acquired a new treasure.

00:30:53.760 --> 00:30:55.240
-Take it and have fun. -Thank you, Uncle.

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:56.600
-I'll be going, then. -All right.

00:30:56.680 --> 00:30:58.000
Thank you, Brother.

00:30:58.080 --> 00:30:59.040
Go on.

00:31:03.480 --> 00:31:04.560
My niece

00:31:04.640 --> 00:31:05.480
Is terribly spoiled.

00:31:05.560 --> 00:31:06.560
Assistant Prefect Wang,

00:31:07.040 --> 00:31:10.280
Take Young Master He to collect the travel pass for Jiuyou City.

00:31:10.360 --> 00:31:11.320
Yes.

00:31:12.080 --> 00:31:13.320
Thank you, Governor Ding.

00:31:14.120 --> 00:31:15.920
Young Master, please follow me.

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:19.160
Wait.

00:31:25.680 --> 00:31:27.480
Young Master He, don't forget.

00:31:27.960 --> 00:31:30.640
You must pay this amount every month.

00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:32.240
If you're even one coin short,

00:31:32.640 --> 00:31:35.560
Shazhou's wild dogs are always hungry.

00:31:46.880 --> 00:31:48.320
Ding Chong, that corrupt dog.

00:31:48.400 --> 00:31:50.520
His greed knows no bounds, and he treats human life as worthless.

00:32:07.680 --> 00:32:09.200
Do you know that female prisoner?

00:32:10.760 --> 00:32:12.240
We must close the net tomorrow.

00:32:12.840 --> 00:32:13.680
Yes.

00:32:16.560 --> 00:32:18.200
These are the deeds to the estates in my name.

00:32:18.280 --> 00:32:20.080
Pawn them and use the money to ransom Mengmeng.

00:32:22.680 --> 00:32:23.840
Here. Take this as well.

00:32:23.920 --> 00:32:26.200
Miss, this is the last of the dowry your mother left you.

00:32:26.640 --> 00:32:28.040
Mengmeng is in trouble because of me.

00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:29.160
I can't stand by and do nothing.

00:32:29.240 --> 00:32:30.200
If Mother were alive,

00:32:30.280 --> 00:32:31.920
She would agree with me.

00:32:32.000 --> 00:32:33.440
Ding Chong only wants money, doesn't he?

00:32:34.320 --> 00:32:35.160
Then I'll give it to him.

00:32:35.240 --> 00:32:36.080
Careful.

00:32:36.480 --> 00:32:37.600
-Hurry. -Yes.

00:32:39.160 --> 00:32:40.560
-How dare you! -Madam.

00:32:41.040 --> 00:32:43.080
You dare take the Yan family's property without permission?

00:32:45.040 --> 00:32:46.720
This is the dowry my mother left me.

00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:47.640
What business is it of yours?

00:32:47.720 --> 00:32:48.760
Yan Fuzhi!

00:32:49.680 --> 00:32:50.880
In this family,

00:32:50.960 --> 00:32:53.960
Isn't everything here the fruit of your father's hard work?

00:32:54.040 --> 00:32:55.240
And yet you

00:32:55.320 --> 00:32:56.680
Betray your own family for an outsider.

00:32:57.360 --> 00:32:58.360
You defiant wretch!

00:32:58.440 --> 00:33:00.800
I'll beat you to death!

00:33:00.880 --> 00:33:03.120
You're hurting my mother!

00:33:06.480 --> 00:33:09.080
Mother!

00:33:09.160 --> 00:33:11.920
Be good, Song'er. Don't cry.

00:33:12.000 --> 00:33:14.080
Tomorrow, Father will buy you a new one.

00:33:15.360 --> 00:33:16.720
-Take him to his father. -Yes.

00:33:19.160 --> 00:33:20.760
You offended Ding Chong,

00:33:20.840 --> 00:33:22.160
And got the restaurant sealed.

00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:24.480
Do you know how much silver your father must give Ding Chong

00:33:24.560 --> 00:33:25.680
To repair this relationship?

00:33:25.760 --> 00:33:26.960
-Let's go. -Stop her!

00:33:28.680 --> 00:33:29.520
Move aside!

00:33:30.600 --> 00:33:32.520
-Move! -Let go of my mistress!

00:33:34.560 --> 00:33:35.480
Think about it.

00:33:35.560 --> 00:33:37.920
Would your father offend Governor Ding

00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:39.960
For the sake of Meng Tinghui?

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:43.280
He's already arranged a fine marriage for you.

00:33:43.360 --> 00:33:45.200
Be obedient and prepare for your wedding.

00:33:47.240 --> 00:33:48.080
Let go of me!

00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:49.760
I don't know what spell that unwanted orphan

00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:51.400
Has cast on you.

00:33:51.480 --> 00:33:54.240
At her age, she dared attack Song'er.

00:33:54.640 --> 00:33:56.080
She nearly killed your brother.

00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.200
I have no brother.

00:34:00.440 --> 00:34:02.880
Before the first seven days of mourning for my mother had even passed,

00:34:02.960 --> 00:34:04.480
You moved into this house as its mistress.

00:34:05.040 --> 00:34:05.960
It was Mengmeng

00:34:06.560 --> 00:34:08.320
Who stayed with me through those unbearable days.

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:10.920
I have to save her.

00:34:11.640 --> 00:34:13.560
I have to get her to the special examination.

00:34:14.280 --> 00:34:16.720
-Let go of me! -Meng Tinghui offended Ding Chong.

00:34:16.800 --> 00:34:19.400
She'll never leave that jail alive.

00:34:19.480 --> 00:34:20.920
Give up on her.

00:34:24.760 --> 00:34:25.720
Wait.

00:34:32.720 --> 00:34:34.480
All you want is for me to marry

00:34:34.560 --> 00:34:35.840
So you can have the Yan family to yourself, isn't it?

00:34:37.000 --> 00:34:38.800
If you save Mengmeng,

00:34:39.600 --> 00:34:40.560
I, Yan Fuzhi,

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.520
Will put on the bridal robes

00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:45.760
And never speak of business again.

00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:48.480
So now you're willing to yield.

00:34:50.120 --> 00:34:51.040
Too late.

00:34:51.120 --> 00:34:51.960
Go.

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:54.760
Miss!

00:34:58.560 --> 00:34:59.520
Let me out!

00:35:00.800 --> 00:35:01.640
Let me out!

00:35:01.720 --> 00:35:03.160
Mengmeng's provincial exam is almost here.

00:35:03.240 --> 00:35:04.960
She can't stay in jail.

00:35:08.200 --> 00:35:10.240
She can't stay in jail!

00:35:33.560 --> 00:35:35.440
Bet high, and the dice roll one, two, three.

00:35:35.520 --> 00:35:37.560
Bet low, and they come up triple six.

00:35:37.640 --> 00:35:40.520
-This is uncanny. -It's truly uncanny.

00:35:42.000 --> 00:35:43.400
-Drink. -Come on.

00:35:44.160 --> 00:35:45.000
Cheers.

00:35:48.160 --> 00:35:49.400
Young friend,

00:35:49.480 --> 00:35:51.000
Let's switch places.

00:35:51.080 --> 00:35:52.080
Your spot has better luck.

00:35:52.160 --> 00:35:53.000
Wait.

00:36:04.480 --> 00:36:05.400
Come here.

00:36:08.800 --> 00:36:10.760
We were ordered to give her no food or water.

00:36:10.840 --> 00:36:11.880
But now

00:36:11.960 --> 00:36:13.280
We're practically making offerings to her.

00:36:13.360 --> 00:36:14.440
Let's stop playing.

00:36:14.840 --> 00:36:16.320
No one leaves. Keep playing.

00:36:23.080 --> 00:36:24.080
I hear prisoners in that jail

00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:26.080
Often die by "accident."

00:36:26.160 --> 00:36:28.440
Now that Meng Tinghui has fallen into my hands,

00:36:28.520 --> 00:36:29.880
She must be suffering terribly.

00:36:34.760 --> 00:36:36.520
Move faster. Stop dragging your feet.

00:36:36.600 --> 00:36:37.480
Keep it up and I'll slap you again.

00:36:40.040 --> 00:36:40.880
-Come on. -Come on.

00:36:45.120 --> 00:36:46.000
Young friend,

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:47.480
When it comes to gambling,

00:36:47.960 --> 00:36:49.280
Here in Shazhou,

00:36:49.800 --> 00:36:51.240
You're the very best.

00:36:54.880 --> 00:36:55.800
-The best. -The best.

00:36:55.880 --> 00:36:57.080
-Amazing. -Amazing.

00:36:58.720 --> 00:37:00.080
Spend just two days

00:37:01.160 --> 00:37:02.600
Learning from me,

00:37:02.680 --> 00:37:05.600
And your gambling skills will improve by leaps and bounds.

00:37:06.840 --> 00:37:07.880
Meng Tinghui?

00:37:22.120 --> 00:37:23.280
Meng Tinghui.

00:37:23.360 --> 00:37:24.880
Let's see you act so arrogant now.

00:37:28.160 --> 00:37:29.840
Don't expect anyone to save you.

00:37:30.120 --> 00:37:32.720
Yan Fuzhi can barely save herself.

00:37:33.360 --> 00:37:34.640
Bofeng House has been sealed,

00:37:35.080 --> 00:37:36.800
And she's confined at home awaiting marriage.

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:38.240
Her bridal robes are already prepared.

00:37:38.320 --> 00:37:40.680
The whole city of Shazhou knows about the wedding.

00:37:41.680 --> 00:37:44.080
Desperate to get out and save your dear friend?

00:37:44.560 --> 00:37:45.720
What a pity.

00:37:45.800 --> 00:37:47.280
You'll never get the chance.

00:37:49.040 --> 00:37:51.440
I'll keep you trapped here for the rest of your life,

00:37:51.520 --> 00:37:53.520
Wishing you were dead.

00:37:58.040 --> 00:37:59.200
Here. Take a look.

00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:01.880
After all our fighting,

00:38:01.960 --> 00:38:05.000
Your registration form still ended up in my hands.

00:38:05.080 --> 00:38:06.320
Give it back to me.

00:38:07.200 --> 00:38:09.000
You want to become an official that badly?

00:38:09.920 --> 00:38:10.760
Of course.

00:38:11.320 --> 00:38:13.400
With your lowly birth,

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:16.040
The imperial exam is your only way out.

00:38:16.680 --> 00:38:18.520
But I'm different.

00:38:18.600 --> 00:38:20.200
The man backing my uncle

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:21.640
Is second only to one person

00:38:21.720 --> 00:38:24.080
And above everyone else: the Left Chancellor.

00:38:24.880 --> 00:38:26.120
Above every powerful patron

00:38:26.680 --> 00:38:28.000
Stands the law of the realm.

00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:30.960
If the court learns of your crimes,

00:38:32.040 --> 00:38:34.360
It will uproot you and your patron

00:38:35.160 --> 00:38:36.400
Once and for all.

00:38:40.920 --> 00:38:41.880
Stop!

00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:43.520
Stop!

00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:46.040
Stop!

00:38:49.200 --> 00:38:50.400
Meng Tinghui,

00:38:50.480 --> 00:38:51.720
The thing you treasure most

00:38:51.800 --> 00:38:53.760
Is so easy for me to destroy.

00:38:53.840 --> 00:38:55.400
Your registration form is gone.

00:38:55.880 --> 00:38:59.080
You'll never set foot in an examination hall again.

00:39:00.680 --> 00:39:02.480
Remember this well.

00:39:03.200 --> 00:39:05.000
As long as my uncle is here,

00:39:05.520 --> 00:39:07.480
You and Yan Fuzhi

00:39:07.960 --> 00:39:10.760
Will never rise again.

00:39:15.880 --> 00:39:17.320
Meng Tinghui, you...

00:39:17.400 --> 00:39:19.200
A-Xia, quick! Release the venomous snake!

00:39:29.080 --> 00:39:29.960
A-Xia!

00:39:30.600 --> 00:39:32.640
Meng Tinghui, just you wait.

00:39:32.720 --> 00:39:34.040
I'll come torture you every day.

00:39:34.120 --> 00:39:35.880
I'll make you wish you were dead.

00:40:15.400 --> 00:40:16.240
Remember,

00:40:16.320 --> 00:40:18.400
A first-rate pickpocket must take money quickly

00:40:18.920 --> 00:40:20.280
Without leaving the slightest mark.

00:40:21.160 --> 00:40:22.000
Your turn.

00:40:37.320 --> 00:40:38.200
Tinghui.

00:40:39.760 --> 00:40:40.600
Go.

00:40:55.680 --> 00:40:56.760
Tinghui.

00:42:08.000 --> 00:42:09.800
Help! Someone escaped!

00:42:11.760 --> 00:42:12.760
Someone escaped!

00:42:12.840 --> 00:42:14.200
A prisoner has broken out!

00:42:14.560 --> 00:42:15.760
A prisoner escaped!

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:19.240
Who? Who escaped?

00:42:19.320 --> 00:42:21.360
Meng Tinghui. It was Meng Tinghui.

00:42:21.440 --> 00:42:22.520
Meng Tinghui?

00:42:22.600 --> 00:42:24.240
-Split up and search. -Yes.

00:42:25.480 --> 00:42:26.360
Make way!

00:42:27.120 --> 00:42:27.960
Everyone, move!

00:42:28.360 --> 00:42:29.240
Move!

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:30.440
Make way!

00:42:33.200 --> 00:42:34.960
A prisoner escaped! Seal the city gates, now!

00:42:36.920 --> 00:42:37.760
Close the gate!

00:42:45.400 --> 00:42:46.240
Open the gate.

00:42:52.880 --> 00:42:54.160
Entering the city this late?

00:42:54.240 --> 00:42:55.080
Where are you from?

00:42:55.160 --> 00:42:56.720
The capital. I'm visiting relatives.

00:42:59.240 --> 00:43:00.240
-Go. -Close the gate.

00:43:01.664 --> 00:43:03.664
MkvDrama.Net

